<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 5,451 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 5,451 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged down to 5,451 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,449 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>					Oct 30		  Oct 29</p>
<p> Dollar rate			 5,451		   5,449</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	4.31		    3.09</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
